Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat(05-04): v2 context blocks per merged run, labeled as
 the last context step

- the assemble render plans runs from mergeAdjacent and the chunks a parent block covers
- the labeler is applied once after compression in a final render, so aliases follow the
  order the model reads; selection, ordering, merge, compression and budget are unchanged
- blocks are copied into the v2 RetrievalResult; a failing labeler leaves the context unlabelled

